Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:09.86,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Laver Cup returns to Europe{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拉沃尔杯回到了欧洲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.70,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and how they will celebrate.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他们要好好庆祝了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:16.41,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}昨天 他握着赛点 被德米纳尔逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:17.99,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}今天欧洲队{\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:19.83,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}只差这一场的三分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.42,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}兹维列夫拿下了 这是他第四次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:25.13,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}替欧洲队锁定了拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.73,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}号晚上{\fs78}9{\fs68}点多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.61,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}拉沃尔杯第三天 也是最后一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:33.23,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}兹维列夫对勒纳 钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:35.29,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}他第一次参加拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:37.21,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第一盘五平 钱发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:39.72,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:42.00,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这一分钱被压到底线后面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:44.67,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}兹维列夫在网前一板一板扣高压
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:46.63,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}他一板一板往回捡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:49.47,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}整座球馆 看得站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:06.20,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that is what the Laver Cup is all about.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这就是拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.02,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这一分是钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.58,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点 他全都救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:12.20,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}保住了发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.42,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}世界队的替补席
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:14.89,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}全都站起来鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:17.52,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}队长阿加西笑得捂住了脸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:20.07,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第一盘 打进了抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:27.09,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}抢七 兹维列夫{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:30.38,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第一个 他就兑现了 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:34.74,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not pretty. But priceless for Team Europe{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不算漂亮 但对欧洲队来说无价
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:39.50,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as Zverev grabs the opener on the tiebreak.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫在抢七里拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:42.32,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第一盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}小时{\fs78}10{\fs68}分钟 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:43.78,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}最后一天一场三分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.25,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}欧洲队离捧杯只差一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:48.96,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 钱发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.26,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a reply there from Tien{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N钱这一拍回得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:01.30,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hanging on to the sideline{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N压在了边线上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:02.95,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 钱发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:06.26,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}兹维列夫逼出他一个反手失误 破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.38,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}下一局 兹维列夫自己{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.17,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点 他一个没给
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:17.80,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Five straight points for Team Europe{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N欧洲队连拿五分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:21.43,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68} 拉沃尔杯点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:22.69,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}去年在旧金山
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.28,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}最后一场他输给了弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:28.29,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这一次 第一个点他就拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:32.17,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}小时{\fs78}49{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.71,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}欧洲队{\fs78}13{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.63,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}拉沃尔杯回到欧洲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:38.78,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}全队冲进场 把他围在中间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.03,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}他走到世界队的替补席
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:45.32,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}和勒纳 钱握手 一个一个道谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.79,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}奖杯回到了欧洲 明年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:50.06,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}欧洲队还守得住吗？
